L84: GLM-4.6
L85: 
L86:   * We’ve launched GLM-4.6, the flagship coding model, showcasing enhanced performance in both public benchmarks and real-world programming tasks, making it the leading coding model in China.
L87:   * The update also expands the context window to 200K, improving its ability to handle longer code and complex agent tasks. Learn more in our cite25†documentation .*
